meta {
  name: adjust stock
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}inventory/stock/adjust/
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    // Chamber location code. The chamber must already hold a component. Required.
    "location": "A21",

    // The counted quantity, >= 0, and different from the current quantity. Required.
    "new_quantity": "58",

    // Why the count changed. Required.
    "reason": "Physical count found 2 missing"
  }
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  Corrects a chamber's quantity after a physical count (FR-6.4). **Admin only**.
  `reason` is required. The movement records `quantity_before` /
  `quantity_after` and the difference: going down it has a
  `source_location`, going up a `destination_location`.

  Rules shared by every stock operation (FR-6):
  - Locations are chamber codes such as `A11` (case-insensitive).
  - A chamber holds one component type (FR-6.2).
  - Quantities must be greater than zero and whole numbers for units that don't allow fractions.
  - Each operation writes an immutable movement (FR-6.5) and runs with row locks, so concurrent operations can't drive a chamber below zero (FR-6.11).
  - The response has the `movement` and the resulting `stock_entries`.

  ## API example response
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Stock adjusted.",
    "movement": {
      "id": 10,
      "movement_type": "ADJUST",
      "movement_type_display": "Adjust",
      "component": {
        "id": 2,
        "name": "LM7805 Voltage Regulator",
        "part_number": "LM7805",
        "unit_symbol": "pcs"
      },
      "source_location": "A21",
      "destination_location": null,
      "quantity": "2.000",
      "quantity_before": "60.000",
      "quantity_after": "58.000",
      "unit_price": null,
      "delivery_charge": null,
      "performed_by": {
        "id": 1,
        "username": "admin",
        "email": "admin@example.com",
        "role": "ADMIN"
      },
      "project": null,
      "related_movement": null,
      "note": "Physical count found 2 missing",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T22:17:36.699528+06:00"
    },
    "stock_entries": [
      {
        "id": 2,
        "location": "A21",
        "chamber": 5,
        "component": {
          "id": 2,
          "name": "LM7805 Voltage Regulator",
          "part_number": "LM7805",
          "unit_symbol": "pcs"
        },
        "quantity": "58.000",
        "note": "",
        "created_at": "2026-09-14T22:17:36.612275+06:00",
        "updated_at": "2026-09-14T22:17:36.698891+06:00"
      }
    ]
  }

  As a Manager (403):
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "Only Admins can perform this action."
  }
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}
